 ends its turn without dealing damage to another creature, the sinmold takes @Damage[3d6[mental]] damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!4ID46JPiJrvUjzNe.6FLJPX5aNUrFnuWr"},{"_id":"no9JeqHYDCcPoIlD","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Digestion","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>The first time in a round when the sinmold damages a creature with Engulf, the sinmold immediately restores Hit Points equal to the damage dealt, gaining Hit Points in excess of its maximum as temporary Hit Points that last for 1 hour. As long as the sinmold possesses these temporary Hit Points, its surface hardens, and its AC increases to 30.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["healing"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!4ID46JPiJrvUjzNe.no9JeqHYDCcPoIlD"},{"_id":"3GISQ73AHrryXuV0","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.zU3Ovaet4xQ5Gmvy"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Engulf","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Check[reflex|dc:32|options:damaging-effect,inflicts:grabbed,inflicts:slowed], @Damage[3d10[acid]] damage plus digestion, [[/act escape dc=32]], Rupture 18</p><hr /><p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Engulf]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"engulf","traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!4ID46JPiJrvUjzNe.3GISQ73AHrryXuV0"},{"_id":"ChHQV3DvokqMb4HQ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Sinmold Infestation","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:32]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[2d8[poison]] damage (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[3d8[poison]] damage and can hear the thoughts of root rotters within 30 feet as an imprecise sense (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> as stage 2, but @Damage[4d8[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> as stage 3, and arise as a root rotter upon death (1 round)</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["poison"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!4ID46JPiJrvUjzNe.ChHQV3DvokqMb4HQ"},{"_id":"CIQeKlHmGrKtUzcR","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Spore Purge","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The sinmold has temporary Hit Points from digestion</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The sinmold loses all temporary Hit Points and releases any creatures it currently has engulfed, pushing them into the nearest unoccupied spac